# Research's search accounts (docs/SERVER.md §3.7). Copy to .env.search, which is never committed.
# compose loads it into the search service and both engines; each reads only its own variable.

# The search service: the residential proxy for the paid search engine, billed per GB, as
# http://<user>:<password>_country-US@core-residential.evomi.com:1000 (not the dashboard's
# host:port:user:password). Percent-encode special characters in the password.
# Empty: the paid engine goes direct, and our IP is blocked by it.
SEARCH_PROXY_URL=

# The engines: Tavily's search API (https://app.tavily.com), one key shared by both bots. Its free
# credits (1,000 a month) are paced evenly through the month. Empty: no Tavily.
TAVILY_API_KEY=
